 162:../Configurations/Ifx_Cfg_Ssw.c **** /* Hook API to shutdown the unused power domains
 163:../Configurations/Ifx_Cfg_Ssw.c ****  * This hook is referenced in Startup sequence. This need to be configured by application to
 164:../Configurations/Ifx_Cfg_Ssw.c ****  * to shutdown the unused power domains. This hook is by default defined to empty call by startup i
 165:../Configurations/Ifx_Cfg_Ssw.c ****  */
